<title>USA: Norstan Inc Q3 net rises with margins.</title>
<headline>Norstan Inc Q3 net rises with margins.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Minn. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norstan Inc said on Tuesday record revenues and solid operating margins helped earnings in the third quarter ended February 1 climb.</p>
<p>The company said net income reached $2.7 million, or $0.29 a share, versus $2.3 million, or $0.26 a share, a year ago.</p>
<p>Strong growth in integration services helped revenues in the period rise to $94.1 million from $81.6 million, Norstan said.</p>
<p>Norstan provides integrated voice, video and data services.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 3/4 Tuesday at 16-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
